			"Message": "feat(Output): Add Electron environment variable for build targeting\n\nAdd a new `Electron` environment variable to ESBuild configuration that enables building for Electron in addition to the existing Browser target. Update the exclusion logic in Bootstrap and Electron filter modules to properly handle three build scenarios:\n\n- Electron=true: Include all electron-browser paths (no exclusions, desktop workbench included)\n- Browser=true: Exclude electron-browser paths (browser-only build)\n- Neither set: Default behavior with no exclusions\n\nThis enables Land to build against VS Code's Electron-specific code paths when targeting the Electron platform.",
			"SHA": "44b359b812a562c03d136190d4b0fcdfdc7ce820"
