				120,
				32
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Output): Lazy-load RestPlugin only when Compiler=Rest env var is set\n\nChange RestPlugin from eager import to lazy loading, loading the plugin dynamically only when Compiler=Rest environment variable is explicitly set. This avoids importing RestPlugin (and its node:fs dependencies) during normal ESBuild builds.\n\n- Update Source/ESBuild/Output.ts and Configuration/ESBuild/Output.js to conditionally import RestPlugin\n- Replace `createRestPluginIfEnabled()` with lazy import: `await import(\"./RestPlugin.js\").then((M) => M.createRestPluginIfEnabled())`\n- Simplify filter from `(plugin) => plugin !== null` to `Boolean`\n- Reformat all ESBuild configuration files for consistent style\n- Update prepublishOnly.sh build commands with correct file patterns and paths\n\nThis improves build performance by avoiding unnecessary module resolution when using the default ESBuild compiler.",
			"SHA": "4a52e182eb6eccd1535e870b543fa61cf900d5b0"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-06T06:32:14Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
